'''Qau''', '''Central Gelao''', or '''Sinicized Gelao''' ({{lang-zh|s=汉仡佬|p=Hàn Gēlǎo}}) is a [[Gelao languages|Gelao]] language spoken in [[Guizhou]], China.<ref name="zhang">{{Cite book |last=Zhang |first=Jimin 张済民 |title=Gēlǎoyǔ yánjiū |date=1993 |publisher=Guizhou minzu chubanshe |location=Guiyang |language=zh |script-title=zh:仡佬语研究 |trans-title=A Study of Gelao}}</ref><ref>{{Cite book |last=Zhou |first=Guoyan 周国炎 |title=Gēlǎozú mǔyǔ shēngtài yánjiū |date=2004 |publisher=Minzu chubanshe |location=Beijing |language=zh |script-title=zh:仡佬族母語生态硏究 |trans-title=Studies on the Linguistic Ecology of the Gelao People}}</ref>

==Dialects==
The dialects of Qau that are still spoken are:<ref>{{Cite book |last=Li |first=Jinfang 李锦芳 |title=Xīnán dìqū bīnwēi yǔyán diàochá yánjiū |date=2006 |publisher=Zhongyang minzu daxue chubanshe |location=Beijing |language=zh |script-title=zh:西南地区濒危语言调查研究 |trans-title=Studies on Endangered Languages in the Southwest China}}</ref>
*Dagouchang 大狗场 or Pingba Qau (in [[Pingba County]])
*Wanzi 湾子 or Anshun Qau (in [[Anshun]] City)

